#: src/postulo/plugins/employer_structure/__init__.py
msgid "Companies with a structure"
msgstr "Cuideachtaí a bhfuil struchtúr acu"

#: src/postulo/plugins/employer_structure/__init__.py
msgid "Record that one company is part of another, keep departments inside a company, and say which part of a company an application was aimed at. Switched off, Postulo shows one company per posting and nothing else; the parents, the departments and the attachments stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Taifead go bhfuil cuideachta amháin ina cuid de chuideachta eile, coinnigh ranna taobh istigh de chuideachta, agus luaigh cén chuid de chuideachta ar a raibh iarratas dírithe. Múchta, ní thaispeánann Postulo ach cuideachta amháin in aghaidh an fhógra poist agus dada eile; fanann na máthairchuideachtaí, na ranna agus na ceangail taifeadta agus tagann siad ar ais gan athrú nuair a chuirtear ar siúl arís é."
